# TASK: Optimize Rental-Ops-Manager for Both Codex and Claude Code

## PROJECT

Repository: `danielaplan/Rental-Ops-Manager`

AI development assistants:
- OpenAI Codex
- Claude Code

Documentation system: Unified Obsidian Second Brain

## MAIN OBJECTIVE

Create a shared, accurate, lightweight **AI Project Knowledge Index** that allows both Codex and Claude Code to understand and navigate the Rental-Ops-Manager repository efficiently.

The project already contains extensive documentation explaining its frontend, backend, database, business workflows, requirements, implementation history, and approved development decisions.

The goal is NOT to make AI read all documentation every time.

The goal is to help AI identify the **smallest relevant set of files** needed to understand and safely complete a development task.

Both AI assistants must use the same authoritative project knowledge, follow consistent development rules, and maintain documentation when meaningful application changes occur.

